<h2>Password & UX improvements</h2>
<ul>
<li>Warn or require a minimal password strength (use existing <code>pw_strength</code> helper).</li>
<li>Disable/grey-out the "Hide" button until the password meets a threshold or confirmation is accepted.</li>
<li>Prompt the user when password is weak: <code>messagebox.askyesno</code>.</li>
</ul>
